cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OliveTwin, please cite it as below."
title: "OliveTwin: interactive visualization of NISAR surface soil moisture over Spanish olive groves"
abstract: >-
  Static web application developed for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
  challenge "Dancing with the SARs". It visualizes NISAR surface soil moisture
  and radar backscatter (provisional products) with Sentinel-2 vegetation,
  terrain, soil and climate over study areas in Spain, and estimates physical
  land suitability for olive, almond and rainfed wheat.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AlRos14 and the OliveTwin contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlRos14/olivetwin"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - NISAR
  - SAR
  - soil moisture
  - olive groves
  - NASA Space Apps Challenge
